{"b":19,"c":4,"v":[[1,[["ye","pr 1:8;pr 6:20-23;ps 34:11;1th 2:11,12"],["attend","pr 2:1-5;pr 5:1;pr 7:4;pr 8:32-36;pr 19:20;pr 22:17;heb 2:1"]]],[2,[["good","pr 8:6-9;pr 22:20,21;de 32:2;job 33:3;ps 49:1-3;joh 7:16,17;1ti 4:6;tit 1:9"],["forsake","1ch 28:9;2ch 7:19;ps 89:30-32"]]],[3,[["For I was my father's son, tender and only beloved in the sight of my mother.","2sa 12:24,25;1ki 1:13-17;1ch 3:5;1ch 22:5;1ch 29:1;jer 10:23;ro 12:16"]]],[4,[["He","pr 22:6;ge 18:19;1ch 22:11-16;1ch 28:9;eph 6:4;2ti 1:5;2ti 3:15"],["Let","pr 3:1;de 4:9;de 6:6;ps 119:11"],["keep","pr 7:2;le 18:3-5;isa 55:3;joh 12:50;heb 5:9"]]],[5,[["Get wisdom","pr 1:22,23;pr 2:2-4;pr 3:13-18;pr 8:5;pr 17:16;pr 18:1;pr 19:8;pr 23:23;jas 1:5"],["neither","2ch 34:2;job 23:11;ps 44:18;ps 119:51,157"]]],[6,[["love","pr 4:21,22;pr 2:10-12;eph 3:17;2th 2:10"]]],[7,[["Wisdom is","ec 7:12;ec 9:16-18;mt 13:44-46;lu 10:42;php 3:8"],["with","pr 16:16;pr 21:6;ps 49:16-20;ec 2:4-9;ec 4:8;mr 8:36,37;lu 12:20"],["get understanding","ps 119:104"]]],[8,[["Exalt her, and she shall promote thee: she shall bring thee to honour, when thou dost embrace her.","pr 3:35;pr 22:4;1sa 2:30;1ki 3:5-13;da 12:3"]]],[9,[["give","pr 1:9;pr 3:22;1ti 2:9,10;1pe 3:4"],["a crown, etc","pr 16:31;isa 28:5;heb 2:7-9;1pe 5:4;re 3:21"]]],[10,[["my","pr 8:10;pr 19:20;job 22:22;jer 9:20;joh 3:32,33;1th 2:13;1ti 1:15"],["the","pr 3:2,16;de 5:16;de 6:2"]]],[11,[["taught","pr 4:4;de 4:5;1sa 12:24;ec 12:9"],["led","pr 8:6,9,20;ps 23:3;ps 25:4,5;ac 13:10"]]],[12,[["thou goest","pr 6:22;2sa 22:37;job 18:7,8;ps 18:36"],["thou shalt","pr 4:19;pr 3:23;ps 91:11,12;ps 119:165;jer 31:9;joh 11:9,10;ro 9:32,33;1pe 2:8;1jo 2:10,11"]]],[13,[["Take","pr 3:18;pr 23:23;ac 2:42;ac 11:23;1th 5:21;heb 2:1;re 2:13;re 12:11"],["let","ge 32:26;so 3:4;lu 24:27-29;joh 4:39-42"],["she","pr 3:22;de 32:47;ec 7:12;joh 6:68"]]],[14,[["Enter not into the path of the wicked, and go not in the way of evil men.","pr 1:10,15;pr 2:11,12;pr 9:6;pr 13:20;ps 1:1;ps 26:4,5;1co 15:33"]]],[15,[["Avoid it, pass not by it, turn from it, and pass away.","pr 5:8;pr 6:5;ex 23:7;job 11:14;job 22:23;isa 33:15;eph 5:11;1th 5:22"]]],[16,[["For they sleep not, except they have done mischief; and their sleep is taken away, unless they cause some to fall.","pr 1:16;ps 36:4;isa 57:20;mic 2:1;lu 22:66;joh 18:28;2pe 2:14"]]],[17,[["For they eat the bread of wickedness, and drink the wine of violence.","pr 9:17;pr 20:17;job 24:5,6;ps 14:4;jer 5:26-28;eze 22:25-29;am 8:4-6;mic 3:5;mic 6:12;zep 3:3;mt 23:14;jas 5:4,5"]]],[18,[["But the path of the just is as the shining light, that shineth more and more unto the perfect day.","2sa 23:4;job 11:17;job 23:10;ps 84:7;ho 6:3;zec 14:6,7;mt 5:14,16,45;joh 8:12;2co 3:18;php 2:15;2pe 1:19;2pe 3:18;re 21:23;re 22:5"]]],[19,[["The way of the wicked is as darkness: they know not at what they stumble.","1sa 2:9;job 5:14;job 12:25;job 18:5,6,18;isa 59:9,10;jer 13:16;jer 23:12;mt 7:23;mt 15:14;joh 12:35;1jo 2:11"]]],[20,[["My son, attend to my words; incline thine ear unto my sayings.","pr 5:1;pr 6:20,21;pr 7:1;ps 78:1;ps 90:12;isa 55:3;mt 17:5"]]],[21,[["depart","pr 3:3,21"],["in the","pr 2:1;ps 40:8"]]],[22,[["life","pr 4:4,10"],["health","pr 3:8;pr 12:18;jer 33:6"]]],[23,[["Keep","pr 22:5;pr 23:19;pr 28:26;de 4:9;ps 139:23,24;jer 17:9;mr 14:38;heb 12:15"],["with all diligence","pr 4:7;pr 3:21;pr 11:16;pr 13:3;ec 5:13"],["for","mt 12:35;mt 15:19;mr 7:21-23;jas 1:14,15"]]],[24,[["Put","job 11:14;eze 18:31;eph 4:25-31;col 3:8;jas 1:21,26;1pe 2:1"],["a, etc","pr 8:8,13;pr 17:20;1ti 6:5"]]],[25,[["Let thine eyes look right on, and let thine eyelids look straight before thee.","pr 23:5,33;job 31:1;ps 119:37;mt 6:22"]]],[26,[["Ponder","pr 5:6;ps 119:59;eze 18:28;hag 1:5,7;eph 5:15,17"],["let all thy ways be established","ps 37:23;ps 40:2;1th 3:13;2th 3:3;1pe 5:10"]]],[27,[["Turn","de 5:32;de 12:32;de 28:14;jos 1:7"],["remove","pr 16:17;isa 1:16;ro 12:9"]]]]}